    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "those are good starts. can you go deeper into the \"marketplace of ideas\" part? I want to argue that any government attempt to moderate content actually destroys the natural evolution of truth by introducing state-sponsored bias. like, if the gov decides what's \"misinformation,\" they're basically just controlling the narrative.",
